        308.262451171875,
        112.49003601074219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "dcfec1d7ae53dcecb574bd0234b6caa8db4af09fa441ed8374308e059fd2e434"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "Minocycline 200mg/day\n(+ antipsychotic)41,42\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88740539550781,
        116.90943908691406,
        142.31741333007812,
        135.79443359375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8d6c9df75611ff7823dc0ee3c7b5ab7f96a971cf64b4f29ed7bff4104e32c0a8"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "May be anti-inflammatory and neuroprotective. One open study (n = 22) and \none RCT (n = 54) suggest good effect on negative and cognitive symptoms. \nAlso one RCT (n = 50) of augmentation of clozapine.43 RCT evidence of \nneuroprotective effect in early psychosis44\n",
      "bbox": [
        177.88890075683594,
        117.04693603515625,
        425.9139709472656,
        155.79693603515625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5238121a8e53436c855911d00f8bf05406011af847d2d22c09888d4e10c2a916"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "Mirtazapine 30mg/day\n(+ antipsychotic)45–47\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        161.93690490722656,
        138.576416015625,
        180.8218994140625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d23024d5e7e0da5a965a0fb4ad70dcf34815da03cbfa9bb039056368bdc957d1"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "5HT2 antagonist. Two RCTs, one negative,46 one positive.45 Effect seems to be \nmainly on positive symptoms\n",
      "bbox": [
        177.88560485839844,
        162.1168975830078,
        425.8880920410156,
        180.8218994140625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "0e782e4055b9da447ac2908e9fe186881a24d445722bef40f18aae0292fc177a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "N-acetylcysteine 2g/day\n(+ antipsychotic)40\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88310241699219,
        196.96192932128906,
        143.1531219482422,
        215.846923828125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a41886f07f89e74eb76666c15d7956c3cf0d2c1a9a6a4d5e2ab6037434f7269a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "One RCT suggests small benefits in negative symptoms and rates of akathisia. \nAnother RCT showed benefits in chronic schizophrenia.48 Case study of \nsuccessful use of 600mg a day.49 Large RCT in progress50\n",
      "bbox": [
        177.88890075683594,
        197.1419219970703,
        427.9240417480469,
        225.84942626953125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ae78fed1ebb79b0639bfeba339d15376e20629a3b5c3153f96476720b20c1b8d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "Olanzapine51–56\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        231.98692321777344,
        113.81187438964844,
        240.87442016601562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c7023381c8f4ae66e1d4eeb343b0f0f6f1c4169894a4735877429e3bcfce3dc7"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "5–25mg/day\nSupported by some well-conducted trials but clinical experience disappointing. \nSome patients show moderate response\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        232.16941833496094,
        430.4241027832031,
        250.87442016601562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d97ce96eea2f4a284a7eec332b73313cb4bdd640a0b9e9df640993825d239b90"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "Olanzapine57–63\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        267.014404296875,
        113.81187438964844,
        275.90191650390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f15354888f1cbebe91ac9e8051391f2a4aff94733b5ff930fbe69ce642ecdae7"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "30–60mg/day\nContradictory findings in the literature but possibly effective. High dose \nolanzapine is not atypical64 and can be poorly tolerated65 with gross metabolic \nchanges63\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        267.1944274902344,
        428.7589416503906,
        295.89691162109375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "7c7a252684a711a4e1a50fc20d0ffc453f2bb3dcb96e60155ba316d4538dcd99"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "Olanzapine + amisulpride66\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        302.0368957519531,
        156.69041442871094,
        310.9244079589844
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ff5595fbebfe6916fe44f4b8d5aa8fe7aa9dd92f9c7dbaaf7f3ade7d34a47cf8"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "(up to 800mg/day)\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        312.2169189453125,
        121.49889373779297,
        320.9244079589844
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e9be388137ed2de8dd71c501ca4a88089d38060277902ff123c0d19c66633c51"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "Small open study suggests benefit\n",
      "bbox": [
        177.8914031982422,
        302.21942138671875,
        286.66400146484375,
        310.9269104003906
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f431ea6c129c31b1e596745cdd8344d68f2b8429ce7eb8b74eac9b4e21b18854"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0018",
      "order": 18,
      "text": "Olanzapine + aripiprazole67\nSingle case report suggests benefit. Probably reduces metabolic toxicity\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        337.06439208984375,
        404.5765075683594,
        345.951904296875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "aa3ed96bdf6d404d8e037e84bf4dc64570e6edc6ed02f17d82a097f4181a505f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "Olanzapine + glycine68\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88639831542969,
        352.0843811035156,
        140.4381103515625,
        360.9718933105469
      ],
      "text_sha256": "275b86f8425845c8548a69367149bf8962977ae8e42c8f2aedb58e2365c39c3b"
    },
