      ],
      "text_sha256": "932fabb0c28d27dfb0b90b1263ff37730ce9dd42307b93bef1007b3f7a12aded"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0024",
      "order": 24,
      "text": "Reports contradictory and rather unconvincing. Reasonable theoretical basis for \nadding lamotrigine which is usually well tolerated\n",
      "bbox": [
        177.8914031982422,
        387.29443359375,
        433.2065734863281,
        405.9994201660156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "838d41fcac7856780c2a082d9772b319dccb32897468dd34240bb9edb7b09ddf"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "Olanzapine + risperidone70\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        422.139404296875,
        155.4378204345703,
        431.02691650390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "fc34bfe3fd0afcf629caebf82ef05317e097eeb2bdaf32969ee2355d263e8abb"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0026",
      "order": 26,
      "text": "(various doses)\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        432.3169250488281,
        108.56888580322266,
        441.0244140625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5e02a906114ef21d711b8ca4afbba949e7f29c0280e42a356bb043606f493fd7"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0027",
      "order": 27,
      "text": "Small study suggests some patients may benefit from combined therapy after \nsequential failure of each drug alone\n",
      "bbox": [
        177.8914031982422,
        422.3194274902344,
        426.9364929199219,
        441.0244140625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "fec77725bfb712ea0867049b07e0d5a507acf2bed6a1219a56e4d0768208b420"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0028",
      "order": 28,
      "text": "Olanzapine + sulpiride71\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
        457.1643981933594,
        145.85301208496094,
        466.0519104003906
      ],
      "text_sha256": "bc4e02b20eff5ef712c31f31a98dfcdf39b344b2ac2098f7884ad655a16b3694"
    },
