        526.0944213867188
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2aa33ff7aa18aaf5c6ed78a389531e79838f6972b61e85a99e9d5b52e8955338"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0033",
      "order": 33,
      "text": "A systematic review of RCTs showed improvements in negative symptoms and \ngeneral psychopathology. Effect on cognition inconclusive74\n",
      "bbox": [
        177.88890075683594,
        507.3894348144531,
        428.8915100097656,
        526.0944213867188
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c0174461c961b210b64d1e29be57435a8aad47e66e90443827b75703f1d0cfcd"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0221-block-0034",
      "order": 34,
      "text": "Paliperidone LAI\nImprovement in endocrine and hepatic parameters and lower antipsychotic \nexposure in a small number of patients switched from clozapine to paliperidone \n3 monthly. No data on clinical outcomes75\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88890075683594,
